    subgraph "AFTER HACS Conversion"
        I[Repository Root] --> J[custom_components/]
        I --> K[hacs.json]
        I --> L[README.md]
        I --> M[info.md]
        I --> N[.github/workflows/]
        I --> O[.gitignore]
        I --> P[License]

        J --> Q[integration_name/]
        Q --> R[__init__.py]
        Q --> S[sensor.py]
        Q --> T[manifest.json]
        Q --> U[config_flow.py]
        Q --> V[const.py]
        Q --> W[Other Python files]

        K --> K1[HACS Configuration:<br/>- name<br/>- content_in_root: false<br/>- domains<br/>- homeassistant version<br/>- render_readme]

        T --> T1[Enhanced manifest:<br/>- domain<br/>- name<br/>- version<br/>- documentation<br/>- issue_tracker<br/>- codeowners<br/>- requirements<br/>- dependencies]

        N --> N1[Validation Workflows:<br/>- hassfest.yaml<br/>- hacs.yaml<br/>- tests.yaml]

        M --> M1[Rich HACS UI content<br/>with formatting]
