        style I fill:#ccffcc
        style J fill:#eeffee
        style K fill:#eeffee
        style T fill:#eeffee
        style N fill:#eeffee
    end

    subgraph "Key Differences"
        AA[File Structure] --> BB[Before: Flat structure<br/>After: Nested under custom_components/]
        CC[Manifest] --> DD[Before: Basic fields<br/>After: Enhanced with version, codeowners, etc.]
        EE[Installation] --> FF[Before: Manual download/copy<br/>After: One-click via HACS]
        GG[Validation] --> HH[Before: No automated checks<br/>After: GitHub Actions workflows]
        II[Documentation] --> JJ[Before: README only<br/>After: README + info.md for rich UI]
        KK[Distribution] --> LL[Before: Direct GitHub download<br/>After: HACS marketplace]
    end

    style AA fill:#fff2cc
    style CC fill:#fff2cc
